  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Long-wearing</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Liquid Formula</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Fragrance Free</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><b>What it is: </b>A water-based, non-permanent brow tint for natural-looking texture and long-lasting hold.<br><br><b>Highlighted Ingredients: <br></b>- Peptides<br>- <i>Camellia japonica</i> Flower Extract<br><br><b>Ingredient Callouts:</b> Free of parabens, formaldehydes, formaldehyde-releasing agents, phthalates, mineral oil, retinyl palmitate, oxybenzone, coal tar, hydroquinone, sulfates SLS & SLES, triclocarban, triclosan, and contains less than one percent synthetic fragrance. It is also vegan, gluten-free, and cruelty-free.<br><br><b>What Else You Need to Know: </b>This non-permanent, pigmented formula tints and holds hairs in place, enhancing your natural brows. It contains peptides to help your brows feel full and conditioned, as well as <i>Camellia japonica</i> fl</div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Coat brows with product by gently brushing through. <br>-For stubborn hairs, run through backwards to coat. <br>-Comb hairs upward, then shape brows into place. <br>-Let formula set. <br><b><br>Recycling Instructions:<br></b>-To recycle box, remove any stickers and place box in your home recycling bin.<br>-To recycle packaging, rinse bottle to ensure it is empty, then recycle in your local beauty-recycling bin.</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">-Peptides<br>-<i>Camellia japonica</i> Flower Extract<br><br>Aqua /Water/Eau, VP/VA Copolymer, Alcohol, Acrylates Copolymer, Butylene Glycol, Glycerin, Caramel, Phenoxyethanol, PVP, Panthenol, Sodium Hydroxide, Camellia Japonica Flower Extract, Ethylhexylglycerin, Sodium Dehydroacetate, Biotinoyl Tripeptide-1 [+/- May Contain/Peut Contenir: Red 40 (CI 16035), Yellow 5 (CI 19140), Blue 1 (CI 42090)].</div></details>",
  "description_html": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Long-wearing</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Liquid Formula</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Fragrance Free</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><b>What it is: </b>A water-based, non-permanent brow tint for natural-looking texture and long-lasting hold.<br><br><b>Highlighted Ingredients: <br></b>- Peptides<br>- <i>Camellia japonica</i> Flower Extract<br><br><b>Ingredient Callouts:</b> Free of parabens, formaldehydes, formaldehyde-releasing agents, phthalates, mineral oil, retinyl palmitate, oxybenzone, coal tar, hydroquinone, sulfates SLS & SLES, triclocarban, triclosan, and contains less than one percent synthetic fragrance. It is also vegan, gluten-free, and cruelty-free.<br><br><b>What Else You Need to Know: </b>This non-permanent, pigmented formula tints and holds hairs in place, enhancing your natural brows. It contains peptides to help your brows feel full and conditioned, as well as <i>Camellia japonica</i> fl</div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Coat brows with product by gently brushing through. <br>-For stubborn hairs, run through backwards to coat. <br>-Comb hairs upward, then shape brows into place. <br>-Let formula set. <br><b><br>Recycling Instructions:<br></b>-To recycle box, remove any stickers and place box in your home recycling bin.<br>-To recycle packaging, rinse bottle to ensure it is empty, then recycle in your local beauty-recycling bin.</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">-Peptides<br>-<i>Camellia japonica</i> Flower Extract<br><br>Aqua /Water/Eau, VP/VA Copolymer, Alcohol, Acrylates Copolymer, Butylene Glycol, Glycerin, Caramel, Phenoxyethanol, PVP, Panthenol, Sodium Hydroxide, Camellia Japonica Flower Extract, Ethylhexylglycerin, Sodium Dehydroacetate, Biotinoyl Tripeptide-1 [+/- May Contain/Peut Contenir: Red 40 (CI 16035), Yellow 5 (CI 19140), Blue 1 (CI 42090)].</div></details>",
